<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="26101849"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="592996714"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="割れたリンゴ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="種田梨沙"/><amll:meta key="album" value="割れたリンゴ / 雪に咲く花"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:13.267"><div begin="00:08.834" end="03:59.244"><p begin="00:08.834" end="00:12.454" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">泣きそうな青リンゴ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">泫然欲泣的青苹果</span></p><p begin="00:12.799" end="00:16.371" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">抱えてる胸の奥<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧拥在内心深处</span></p><p begin="00:16.790" end="00:21.951" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">転がって(キズツイテモ)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无数次跌倒 即使千疮百孔</span></p><p begin="00:18.773" end="00:20.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">強がって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倔强挺胸</span></p><p begin="00:20.853" end="00:24.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">窮屈な空睨む<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仰头瞪视着 这压抑天空</span></p><p begin="00:24.773" end="00:32.239" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">運命に従順に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对命运不得不顺从</span></p><p begin="00:32.706" end="00:39.259" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">熟すのを待つもんか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谁会等到那时候啊</span></p><p begin="00:40.823" end="00:44.812" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">千の風(あがいて)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">风吹雨打 屹立不动</span></p><p begin="00:44.812" end="00:48.810" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">吹け吹け(叫んで)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可那风儿 越吼越凶</span></p><p begin="00:48.810" end="00:52.827" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">わたしは(それでも)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我依然 梦想在胸</span></p><p begin="00:52.827" end="00:56.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">しゃぼん玉(信じてる)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">肥皂泡中 定有彩虹</span></p><p begin="00:56.840" end="01:00.809" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">予期せぬ(上昇して)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">意想不到 腾云行空</span></p><p begin="01:00.809" end="01:04.822" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">嵐に(下降して)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">偶尔迷失 风暴之中</span></p><p begin="01:04.822" end="01:08.813" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">あらがう(それでも)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抗争不止 信念不松</span></p><p begin="01:08.813" end="01:12.804" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">しゃぼん玉(生きてく)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">肥皂泡儿 亦能腾空</span></p><p begin="01:12.804" end="01:15.826" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">弾ける瞬間<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">破裂瞬间</span></p><p begin="01:16.264" end="01:19.074" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">虹、放て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绽放彩虹</span></p><p begin="01:20.805" end="01:26.123" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">懸命に(クルシクテモ)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">竭尽全力 即便艰苦</span></p><p begin="01:22.900" end="01:24.377" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">水遣って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">给割裂的 梦想之种</span></p><p begin="01:24.844" end="01:28.323" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">ひび割れた 夢の種<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">浇灌水分</span></p><p begin="01:28.819" end="01:34.014" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">ためらいを(フルエナガラ)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将这踌躇 哪怕有些惊恐</span></p><p begin="01:30.887" end="01:32.429" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">蹴破って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用力踢破</span></p><p begin="01:32.851" end="01:36.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">いつの日か空掴め<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终究有一日 要抓住苍穹</span></p><p begin="01:36.842" end="01:44.421" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">誰かの花壇に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">岂能当个在温室里</span></p><p begin="01:44.795" end="01:51.246" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">行儀よく咲くもんか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被细心照料的花朵</span></p><p begin="01:52.913" end="01:56.831" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">太陽(堕ちそうで)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便太阳 即将西沉</span></p><p begin="01:56.831" end="02:00.803" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">凝視める(折れそうで)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依然凝视 满身疮痍</span></p><p begin="02:00.803" end="02:04.794" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">わたしは(それでも)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">然而我却 依然如昔</span></p><p begin="02:04.794" end="02:08.808" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">野の花(やめない)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">荒野之花 永不言弃</span></p><p begin="02:08.808" end="02:12.802" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">断崖に(翻弄され)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">断崖之壁 狂风舞动</span></p><p begin="02:12.802" end="02:16.767" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">咲いてる(狼狽して)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依然盛开 狼狈不已</span></p><p begin="02:16.767" end="02:20.739" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">名も無き(それでも)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">默默无名 即便孤寂</span></p><p begin="02:20.739" end="02:24.824" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">野の花(負けない)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">荒野之花 未尝败绩</span></p><p begin="02:24.824" end="02:27.819" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">キレイなままで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">维持着纤丽</span></p><p begin="02:28.295" end="02:31.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">摘まれたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">待得被摘采之日</span></p><p begin="02:34.275" end="02:37.715" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">(コワクナイヨ)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毫不畏惧</span></p><p begin="02:42.219" end="02:45.719" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">(ウソジャナイヨ)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝不是谎言</span></p><p begin="02:47.301" end="02:48.299" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">(デモ...)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是</span></p><p begin="03:04.814" end="03:11.043" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">心のリンゴ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中的苹果</span></p><p begin="03:12.649" end="03:19.029" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">割れるなら青いまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依旧青涩，即便被割破</span></p><p begin="03:20.833" end="03:24.802" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">千の風(あがいて)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">风吹雨打 屹立不动</span></p><p begin="03:24.802" end="03:28.797" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">吹け吹け(叫んで)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可那风儿 越吼越凶</span></p><p begin="03:28.797" end="03:32.788" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">わたしは(それでも)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我依然 梦想在胸</span></p><p begin="03:32.788" end="03:36.828" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">しゃぼん玉(信じてる)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">肥皂泡中 定有彩虹</span></p><p begin="03:36.828" end="03:40.818" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">予期せぬ(上昇して)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">意想不到 腾云行空</span></p><p begin="03:40.818" end="03:44.809" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">嵐に(下降して)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">偶尔迷失 风暴之中</span></p><p begin="03:44.809" end="03:48.800" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">あらがう(それでも)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抗争不止 信念不松</span></p><p begin="03:48.800" end="03:52.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">しゃぼん玉(生きてく)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">肥皂泡儿 亦能腾空</span></p><p begin="03:52.840" end="03:55.884" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">弾ける瞬間<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">破裂瞬间</span></p><p begin="03:56.266" end="03:59.244" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">虹、放て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绽放彩虹</span></p></div></body></tt>